1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Proper sleep is essential to health.

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,620
What results have been obtained from 15 years of research on adult

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,679
sleep?

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:12,320
A University Hospital research team has observed 9,000 adults aged 40 to

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,820
60 for 15 years.

6
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:20,580
Sleeping more than 8 hours increased the risk of death by 27%

7
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:24,960
Less than seven hours of sleep was 11% higher.

8
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,580
There were also age-related differences.

9
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:30,910
When the age of 40 is low, over 60 are more vulnerable

10
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:34,240
to poor sleep.

11
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:38,390
The average Korean sleep time was 6 hours 58 minutes, 18% less

12
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:41,859
than the OECD average.

13
00:00:41,859 --> 00:00:45,039
The daily rate of sleeping was only 7%, which was less than

14
00:00:45,039 --> 00:00:48,219
half the global average.

15
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:52,690
The study team advised that regular sleep habits and a seven-hour period

16
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:56,340
of adequate sleep are key to maintaining good health.

17
00:00:57,579 --> 00:01:03,890
The study team advised that regular sleep habits and a seven-hour period

